{
  "name": "zcode-token-usage-statusbar",
  "version": "1.6.0",
  "description": "ZCode quota status bar: provider quota for the current model (MiniMax Token Plan, ClinePass, Kimi, GLM, OpenCode Go windows with reset countdowns; DeepSeek, Moonshot, SiliconFlow, StepFun, OpenRouter balances), plus generation speed and token usage. By default it auto-installs the floating bar, which modifies app.asar; fully quit and reopen ZCode to take effect. An explicit opt-out is respected.",
